skill_gaps_summary: "The candidate has significant gaps in both experience level and specific technical skills required for the role. The 5-year experience gap is insurmountable in the short term. The complete lack of FastAPI ecosystem experience and backend API development would require extensive training. While technical skills could be learned, the senior-level position requires immediate framework maintenance capabilities that aren't present."
